### ERP API Test Suite
### Base URL: https://erp-9pbn.onrender.com/api/v1/
### Tests for all 36 APIs

### ============================================================
### BASE URL VARIABLE - UPDATE THIS FOR DIFFERENT ENVIRONMENTS
### ============================================================
@baseurl = https://erp-9pbn.onrender.com/api/v1

### ============================================================
### IMPORTANT: TOKEN WORKFLOW
### ============================================================
### 1. First, run the LOGIN request below to get the auth_token
### 2. Copy the auth_token value from the response
### 3. Replace TOKEN_VALUE with the copied token in all other requests
### 4. All Bearer token requests will now work
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS (6 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. Login - POST /auth/login/
### ⭐ RUN THIS FIRST TO GET TOKEN ⭐
POST @baseurl/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rishab@gmail.com",
  "password": "rishu1234"
}

### SAVE THE auth_token FROM RESPONSE AND USE BELOW:
@token = 5a743e38ec213f224e20026ea1fa69a75700aa50

### 2. Get User Profile - GET /auth/profile/
GET @baseurl/auth/profile/
Authorization: Token @token

### 3. Update Profile - PUT /auth/update-profile/
PUT @baseurl/auth/update-profile/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Rutuja",
  "last_name": "Updated",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "New Address"
}

### 4. Change Password - POST /auth/change-password/
POST @baseurl/auth/change-password/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "rutu12345",
  "new_password": "newpassword123",
  "confirm_password": "newpassword123"
}

### 5. Logout - POST /auth/logout/
POST @baseurl/auth/logout/
Authorization: Token @token

### 6. Refresh Token - POST /auth/refresh-token/
POST @baseurl/auth/refresh-token/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "old_refresh_token_here"
}

### ============================================================
### STUDENT ENDPOINTS (6 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. List All Students - GET /students/
GET @baseurl/students/
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. Get Student Details - GET /students/{id}/
GET @baseurl/students/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### 3. Get Student Attendance - GET /students/{id}/attendance/
GET @baseurl/students/1/attendance/
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. Get Student Marks - GET /students/{id}/marks/
GET @baseurl/students/1/marks/
Authorization: Token @token

### 5. Get Student Fee Status - GET /students/{id}/fees/
GET @baseurl/students/1/fees/
Authorization: Token @token

### 6. Get Student Fee Payments History - GET /students/{id}/fee-payments/
GET @baseurl/students/1/fee-payments/
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### FACULTY ENDPOINTS (5 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. List All Departments - GET /departments/
GET @baseurl/departments/
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. List All Courses - GET /courses/
GET @baseurl/courses/
Authorization: Token @token

### 3. List All Subjects - GET /subjects/
GET @baseurl/subjects/
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. List All Classes - GET /classes/
GET @baseurl/classes/
Authorization: Token @token

### 5. Get Teacher's Assigned Subjects - GET /teachers/{id}/subjects/
GET @baseurl/teachers/1/subjects/
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### ATTENDANCE ENDPOINTS (3 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. List Attendance Records - GET /attendance/
GET @baseurl/attendance/
Authorization: Token @token

### 1b. List Attendance by Student - GET /attendance/?student_id=1
GET @baseurl/attendance/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. Mark Attendance - POST /attendance/
POST @baseurl/attendance/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": 1,
  "subject": 1,
  "date": "2026-01-03",
  "status": true,
  "classes_held": 2,
  "classes_attended": 2,
  "marked_by": 1
}

### 3. Delete Attendance - DELETE /attendance/{id}/
DELETE @baseurl/attendance/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### FEES ENDPOINTS (4 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. Record Fee Payment - POST /fees/payments/
POST @baseurl/fees/payments/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": 1,
  "amount": "5000.00",
  "payment_date": "2026-01-03",
  "payment_method": "online",
  "transaction_id": "TXN123456",
  "status": "paid"
}

### 2. Get Student Payment History - GET /fees/payments/?student_id=1
GET @baseurl/fees/payments/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### Alternative: Get Student Payment History (via action)
GET @baseurl/fees/payments/student_payments/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### 3. Get Student Due Fees - GET /fees/student_due/?student_id=1
GET @baseurl/fees/payments/student_due/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. Send Fee Reminder - POST /fees/payments/send_reminder/
POST @baseurl/fees/payments/send_reminder/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id": 1
}

### ============================================================
### MARKS/EXAMS ENDPOINTS (8 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. List All Marks - GET /marks/
GET @baseurl/marks/
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. Create Marks Entry - POST /marks/
POST @baseurl/marks/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": 1,
  "subject": 1,
  "internal_marks": 40,
  "semester_marks": 60
}

### 3. Get Mark Details - GET /marks/{id}/
GET @baseurl/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. Update Marks - PUT /marks/{id}/
PUT @baseurl/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "internal_marks": 42,
  "semester_marks": 65
}

### 5. Delete Marks - DELETE /marks/{id}/
DELETE @baseurl/marks/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### 6. Get Student Marks - GET /marks/by_student/?student_id=1
GET @baseurl/marks/by_student/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### 7. Get Subject Marks - GET /marks/by_subject/?subject_id=1
GET @baseurl/marks/by_subject/?subject_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### 8. Get Result Card - GET /results/?student_id=1
GET @baseurl/results/?student_id=1
Authorization: Token @token

### ============================================================
### NOTIFICATION ENDPOINTS (4 APIs)
### ============================================================

### 1. List Notifications - GET /notifications/
GET @baseurl/notifications/
Authorization: Token @token

### 2. Get Notification Details - GET /notifications/{id}/
GET @baseurl/notifications/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### 3. Mark Notification as Read - PUT /notifications/{id}/mark_read/
PUT @baseurl/notifications/1/mark_read/
Authorization: Token @token

### 4. Delete Notification - DELETE /notifications/{id}/
DELETE @baseurl/notifications/1/
Authorization: Token @token

### 5. Send Announcement to a Specific STUDENT
POST @baseurl/notifications/send-announcement/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_type": "student",
  "target_id": 1, 
  "title": "Individual Alert",
  "message": "Hey, your specific assignment for OSY is pending."
}


### 6. Send Announcement to an Entire CLASS
POST @baseurl/notifications/send-announcement/
Authorization: Token @token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_type": "class",
  "target_id": 1,
  "title": "Class Notice",
  "message": "The lecture scheduled for 2 PM is moved to 4 PM."
}

### ============================================================
### QUICK REFERENCE - API SUMMARY (36 APIS)
### ============================================================

### AUTHENTICATION (6)
### POST   /auth/login/                     - Login user
### GET    /auth/profile/                   - Get user profile
### PUT    /auth/profile/                   - Update profile
### POST   /auth/change-password/           - Change password
### POST   /auth/logout/                    - Logout user
### POST   /auth/refresh-token/             - Refresh authentication token

### STUDENTS (6)
### GET    /students/                       - List all students
### GET    /students/{id}/                  - Get student details
### GET    /students/{id}/attendance/       - Get student attendance
### GET    /students/{id}/marks/            - Get student marks
### GET    /students/{id}/fees/             - Get student fee status
### GET    /students/{id}/fee-payments/     - Get student payment history

### FACULTY (5)
### GET    /departments/                    - List all departments
### GET    /courses/                        - List all courses
### GET    /subjects/                       - List all subjects
### GET    /classes/                        - List all classes
### GET    /teachers/{id}/subjects/         - Get teacher's assigned subjects

### ATTENDANCE (3)
### GET    /attendance/                     - List attendance records
### POST   /attendance/                     - Mark attendance
### DELETE /attendance/{id}/                - Delete attendance record

### FEES (4)
### POST   /fees/payments/                  - Record fee payment
### GET    /fees/payments/?student_id={id}  - Get student payment history
### GET    /fees/payments/student_due/      - Calculate student due fees
### POST   /fees/payments/send_reminder/    - Send fee reminder email

### MARKS/EXAMS (8)
### GET    /marks/                          - List all marks
### POST   /marks/                          - Create marks entry
### GET    /marks/{id}/                     - Get mark details
### PUT    /marks/{id}/                     - Update marks
### DELETE /marks/{id}/                     - Delete marks
### GET    /marks/by_student/?student_id={id} - Get student marks
### GET    /marks/by_subject/?subject_id={id} - Get subject marks
### GET    /results/?student_id={id}        - Get result card

### NOTIFICATIONS (4)
### GET    /notifications/                  - List notifications
### GET    /notifications/{id}/             - Get notification details
### PUT    /notifications/{id}/mark_read/   - Mark notification as read
### DELETE /notifications/{id}/             - Delete notification

### ============================================================
### NOTES:
### - Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with actual authentication token
### - Replace {id} with actual resource ID
### - All endpoints require authentication (except login)
### - Use appropriate HTTP methods: GET (read), POST (create), PUT (update), DELETE (remove)
### - Content-Type: application/json for POST/PUT requests
### ============================================================
